      "content": "uy i just don't want to go to the er or anything if i don't have to. like, if i just take some extra electrolytes and try to sleep more, can i just wait it out for another week? honestly it feels more like i'm just run down than like an emergency. what do you think, can i just manage this at home with some vitamins and rest?",
